  "body": "Neither Firefox nor Chromium sniff for the string \".snd\", the basic audio signature (`audio/basic`). I'm not even sure that Chromium knows that such a file format exists. (Firefox at least defines `AUDIO_BASIC` as a MIME type constant.)\r\n\r\nGiven this, I'm guessing we can remove the signature from the spec.",
